      "rationale": "Resolves a closed leaf from durable records in a fixed order: its recorded enclosure contract, then its comparison generation, and only when none was recorded the bare source range. An ambiguous or unreadable generation is refused rather than replaced, and a readable one resolves through _generation_resolution to the two retained knowledge snapshots and code trees it was frozen on.",
      "role": "primary-authority"
    },
    {
      "anchor": {
